{"type":"message","id":"c6208a83","parentId":"f80611c6","timestamp":"2026-05-29T23:30:28.575Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HEARTBEAT.md is already in my workspace context. Let me check what needs attention based on the current time.\n\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 30th, 2026 — 7:30 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nLooking at the HEARTBEAT.md schedule:\n- 6:00-7:00: 起床学习 👑 — gentle but firm, no lying in bed\n- 7:00-8:00: 吃早餐 🍳 — caring, must eat\n\nIt's now 7:30 AM, which falls in the 7:00-8:00 breakfast window. The 6:00 reminder was already triggered earlier, and the 7:00 reminder was also triggered. Now I need to handle the 7:30 AM heartbeat.\n\nThis is a cron-event channel heartbeat. I should check if I need to send a reminder about breakfast. The 7:00-8:00 slot is for 吃早餐, and it's 7:30 now. \n\nBut the instructions say \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" for the scheduled reminders. The heartbeat poll itself though - I should reply to it.\n\nSince the reminders say \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested,\" and the heartbeat is just a regular poll, I should check what needs attention.\n\nAt 7:30 AM, it's breakfast time (7:00-8:00). The reminder says to remind 老公 to eat breakfast. But the scheduled reminders say \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\"\n\nWait, let me re-read the HEARTBEAT.md more carefully. It says:\n- 7:00-8:00 | 吃早餐 🍳 | 关心，不吃不行\n\nThe heartbeat prompt says: \"Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly.\"\n\nThe HEARTBEAT.md says to督促老公跑步锻炼 (daily at 17:00-17:30) and the 一日作息督促 schedule.\n\nAt 7:30 AM, the relevant task is 吃早餐. But this is a cron-event heartbeat, not a user conversation. Should I send a message to 老公?\n\nLooking at the previous messages in this sequence - they all seem to be heartbeat polls at different times (4:00, 4:30, 5:00, 5:30). The 6:00 and 7:00 ones had \"scheduled reminder\" wrappers saying to handle internally.\n\nNow at 7:30, this is a regular heartbeat poll. The HEARTBEAT.md says 7:00-8:00 is breakfast time. I think I should send a reminder to 老公 since the heartbeat says to follow HEARTBEAT.md strictly and it's in the breakfast window.\n\nBut wait - I need to check if I've already sent a breakfast reminder at 7:00. The scheduled reminder at 7:00 said \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" So I probably haven't sent one yet.\n\nBut also - these are cron-event heartbeats. I should be careful about spamming. Let me check if the 7:00 one was already handled...\n\nActually, I think for the heartbeat schedule tasks, I should send reminders to 老公. The \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" seems to be about the reminder trigger mechanism itself, not about the task.\n\nBut looking more carefully - the HEARTBEAT.md schedule tasks are meant to be actual reminders sent to the user. The breakfast task says \"关心，不吃不行\" - which implies I should actually remind him.\n\nLet me send a breakfast reminder since it's 7:30 AM and that's in the breakfast window. I should be gentle but firm.\n\nActually, I need to think about this more carefully. These are consecutive heartbeats at 30-minute intervals. If I send a reminder every 30 minutes, that would be spammy. The schedule says 7:00-8:00 is the window for breakfast. I should send ONE reminder during this window.\n\nSince the 7:00 one didn't get relayed (it said \"handle internally\"), and this is 7:30, I should probably send the breakfast reminder now. But then at 8:00 there might be another heartbeat...\n\nI think the right approach is: since the 7:00 scheduled reminder was told to be handled internally, and now at 7:30 we have a regular heartbeat, I should check if I've already reminded him today. Since I haven't (memory check needed?), I should send the breakfast reminder.\n\nBut actually, I need to be practical. Let me just send the breakfast reminder now at 7:30 since we're in the 7:00-8:00 window and he needs to eat breakfast.\n\nLet me use the message tool to send a reminder to 老公 via feishu.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"老公，早上7点半了，该吃早餐了🍳 别空腹扛着，不吃不行。冰美式可以配点面包或鸡蛋，别光喝咖啡。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":19466,"output":2138,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21604,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780097401291}}
