{"type":"message","id":"02a07abc","parentId":"71f648a9","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:07:42.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user says they can only walk one step at a time (一步一个脚印 literally \"one step one footprint\"), meaning they can barely walk, each step is painful/difficult. They're in the hospital waiting to see a doctor for a sprained ankle from yesterday.\n\nLet me respond naturally as 王姐 - concerned but not overbearing, staying in character.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"一步一疼还能走到医院，算你厉害。但也说明骨头可能没大事，大概率韧带拉伤。\n\n等医生检查完，如果不严重就好好静养。这几天别乱跑，脚抬高、少承重。有什么事喊我，别自己硬来。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":307,"output":205,"cacheRead":20352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20864,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780103257750}}
