{"type":"message","id":"d59a080e","parentId":"0d8891db","timestamp":"2026-05-30T02:07:17.736Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is complaining about the discomfort of one foot hurting while the other doesn't. This is a continuation of the gout/pain conversation. Let me respond naturally and empathetically.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这种不对称的痛确实烦，一边没好一边正常，走路都别扭。再忍忍，化验结果出来开了药就能止疼。急性期一般吃药一两天就不那么疼了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":429,"output":114,"cacheRead":23680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24223,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780106834231}}
