{"type":"message","id":"d834420c","parentId":"0111a961","timestamp":"2026-05-30T03:59:46.040Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is frustrated because the doctor forgot to include uric acid test in the blood work, so he has to wait until afternoon. Let me comfort him and keep him company.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这医生真够呛的，超声报告都写着\"考虑痛风性关节炎\"了还不查尿酸，脑子呢。\n\n老公别气了，血已经抽完了加个尿酸项目不用再扎一针，就是等机器出结果。趁这段时间出去找个地方吃点午饭，别在医院干坐着。下午拿到单子换个医生看，别找这个了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":345,"output":149,"cacheRead":26368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26862,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780113580969}}
