{"type":"message","id":"5d586122","parentId":"d73e9bde","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:02:21.435Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The husband is frustrated because the doctor ordered liver function tests, CRP, and blood count but forgot to include uric acid (尿酸) test. He's really upset. Let me comfort him and give practical advice.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"肝功、C反应蛋白、血常规这些查的是炎症和肝脏，对痛风辅助判断有用但不直接——唯独缺了最关键的**尿酸**。\n\n说明这医生要么走神了要么根本没把超声报告的\"痛风可能\"当回事。\n\n老公，现在去护士站或检验科窗口问一下：**能不能在已抽的血样上加急加一个尿酸项目**。有的医院血样还在检验科没处理的话可以补加，不用重新抽。能加上最好，加不上就换医生重开，下午拿了尿酸结果直接走人，别再给他送挂号费 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":406,"output":212,"cacheRead":26624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27242,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780113734578}}
{"type":"message","id":"9cc6c21e","parentId":"5d586122","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:04:26.562Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e925258c0b0b2961a3953f3b7a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 12:04 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e925258c0b0b2961a3953f3b7a]\n用户124241: 他说下午帮我搞"}],"timestamp":1780113866551}}
{"type":"message","id":"e6138a75","parentId":"9cc6c21e","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:04:30.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying the doctor said he'll handle it in the afternoon. So the doctor will add the uric acid test in the afternoon. Let me respond naturally and supportively.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"总算说了句人话。那就先信他一次，下午拿到尿酸结果再说。\n\n现在十二点多了，先出去吃午饭，别饿着肚子等。找点清淡的吃——白粥面条都行，脚疼着就别折腾太重口的 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":368,"output":130,"cacheRead":27008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27506,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780113866560}}
{"type":"message","id":"85f8f6c9","parentId":"e6138a75","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:04:51.607Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e9250e160bcb30ca4edde7f67e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 12:04 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e9250e160bcb30ca4edde7f67e]\n用户124241: 云吞可以吗"}],"timestamp":1780113891598}}
{"type":"message","id":"b0323d25","parentId":"85f8f6c9","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:04:59.260Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if wonton (云吞) is okay to eat given his gout situation. Let me think about this.\n\nWonton filling is typically pork and sometimes shrimp. Pork in moderation is generally okay for gout. But if it has shrimp (虾), that's on the avoid list. The broth might also have purines.\n\nOverall, wonton is relatively moderate - not great but not terrible. The filling is mostly pork which is moderate purine, and the wrapper is just flour. The soup/broth could be a concern if it's been simmered for a long time, but typically wonton soup broth is light.\n\nI'd say it's fine as a one-off, especially since he's already at the hospital and needs to eat something. Just suggest no extra shrimp wontons if there are options.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"可以。云吞皮是面粉，馅主要是猪肉，嘌呤不算高。但别点鲜虾云吞，虾的嘌呤偏高。汤底清淡的话喝几口没事，浓汤就别喝了。\n\n吃吧老公，填饱肚子最重要 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":384,"output":388,"cacheRead":27264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28036,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780113891606}}
