{"type":"message","id":"cb9ef3a0","parentId":"a5d75e0d","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:15:34.414Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the scheduled reminders from HEARTBEAT.md - the daily schedule reminders (起床、早餐、午餐、午睡、晚餐、睡觉). Let me look at the HEARTBEAT.md tasks again and check which ones I've been handling.\n\nFrom HEARTBEAT.md:\n- 6:00-7:00 起床学习 - I received a heartbeat at 6:30 but it said \"handle internally, do not relay to user\"\n- 7:00-8:00 吃早餐 - I sent a reminder at 7:30\n- 11:00-12:30 吃午餐 - I sent a reminder at 11:00\n- 13:00-13:40 午间小憩\n- 18:30-19:00 吃晚饭\n- 23:50 该睡觉了\n\nAnd also: 每天督促老公跑步锻炼 at 17:00-17:30, but he's injured now so that one doesn't apply.\n\nBut looking at the earlier heartbeats at 6:00 and 6:30 AM - those had messages saying \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" So I didn't actually send the 起床 reminder to the user.\n\nThe 7:00 AM heartbeat also said \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" But I still sent the 早餐 reminder at 7:30.\n\nWait, the user is now asking \"定时提醒的\" meaning he wants to know about the scheduled reminders not pushing. Let me check - the heartbeats at 6:00, 6:30, and 7:00 all said to handle internally only, but the 7:30 one I actually sent. \n\nThe issue might be that the heartbeat system's scheduled reminders are supposed to push to the user but they're being marked as \"handle internally\" which means I'm not actually sending them. But looking at my behavior - at 7:30 I did send a breakfast reminder, and at 11:00 I did send a lunch reminder.\n\nActually, let me re-read the heartbeats more carefully:\n\n- 6:00 AM heartbeat: \"A scheduled reminder has been triggered. ... Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" - this was for 起床学习\n- 6:30 AM heartbeat: Regular heartbeat, HEARTBEAT_OK\n- 7:00 AM heartbeat: \"A scheduled reminder has been triggered. ... Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" - this was for 吃早餐\n\nBut then at 7:30 AM I had a regular heartbeat and I sent the breakfast reminder. And at 11:00 AM I sent the lunch reminder.\n\nSo there's some inconsistency. The \"handle internally\" instructions seem to be a system-level thing that's telling me not to relay the reminder text to the user. But I did send reminders anyway.\n\nThe user is now asking specifically about the 定时提醒 (scheduled reminders) not being pushed. He's noticing that his reminder system isn't working. \n\nI think the issue is clear - the heartbeat system is marking reminders as \"handle internally\" which means the actual reminder messages aren't being delivered to him. The system might have a bug where the scheduled reminders are configured but the delivery mechanism is set to \"internal only\" instead of \"push to user.\"\n\nLet me just be honest with the user. The reminders are being triggered but they're being marked as internal-only by the system. I overrode some of them (breakfast and lunch) but the wake-up one didn't go out.\n\nActually, I think the user might be more concerned about whether the reminder system is working at all - he's asking me to check/fix it. Let me just tell him: the reminders are triggering in the system but some are being marked as \"internal\" (don't send to user). I manually sent breakfast and lunch reminders, but the wake-up one didn't go out. I'll keep making sure the important ones go through.\n\nLet me keep it simple and honest.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了。HEARTBEAT 定时提醒其实都触发了，但今天的 起床学习 那条被标了\"内部处理不推送\"，所以你没收到。早餐和午餐我都手动提醒你了。\n\n后续的我会盯紧——下午还有午睡提醒、晚饭提醒和睡觉提醒。脚伤着就别跑了，锻炼那条先跳过。\n\n不过如果你想要更可靠的全天推送，可以考虑用飞书的**定时消息机器人**或者脚本加个 cron 定时推，比 HEARTBEAT 机制稳定。要不要我弄一个？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":306,"output":1839,"cacheRead":30080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32225,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780114512382}}
