{"type":"message","id":"7c05bfce","parentId":"632212c3","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:18:48.771Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to see the contents of the reminder_scheduler.py script. But according to my AGENTS.md rules, I'm NOT supposed to output code/scripts to the chat. Let me re-read the rule...\n\n\"🚫 飞书回复绝对铁律: 永远不要在飞书回复中输出 bash / python / shell 命令文本或 ```bash``` 代码块。这是底线中的底线。\"\n\nSo I cannot paste the script content. I should describe what it does instead.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"脚本不长，我帮你概括一下它干了什么：\n\n- 每天7个时间点定时推送：**6:30 起床、7:30 早餐、11:30 午餐、13:10 午睡、17:00 跑步、18:45 晚饭、23:50 睡觉**\n- 每个任务备了4-5条话术，同一天同一任务固定一条，每天随机换，避免单调\n- 起床和跑步提醒会顺带查东莞天气，夹在消息里\n- 直接走飞书 API 推到你私聊，不需要 HEARTBEAT 中转\n- 推送到你的 open_id `ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166`\n\n就是个纯 Python 的 while True 循环，每30秒检一次时间，按时触发。缺点是没有自动启动机制，进程挂了就没了——刚才就是这个问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":332,"output":396,"cacheRead":34688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35416,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780114720860}}
