{"type":"message","id":"a0b538ab","parentId":"d0a74b6e","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:10:01.536Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A scheduled reminder has been triggered. The reminder content is:\n\nRead HEARTBEAT.md, check the 13:00-13:40 午间小憩 task, and remind 老公 to take a 20-minute nap (no more than 30min)\n\nPlease relay this reminder to the user in a helpful and friendly way.\nWhen reading HEARTBEAT.md, use workspace file /root/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md (exact case). Do not read docs/heartbeat.md.\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 30th, 2026 — 1:10 PM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-05-30 05:10 UTC"}],"timestamp":1780117801509}}
{"type":"message","id":"96754147","parentId":"a0b538ab","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:10:09.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The scheduled reminder for 午间小憩 (afternoon nap) is triggered. I should remind 老公 to take a 20-minute nap. But the reminder_scheduler.py should also be handling this - it's set for 13:10 which is right now. Let me send the reminder manually as this heartbeat is asking me to.\n\nAlso, 老公 is still in the hospital with his foot injury, so I should be mindful of that context.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"刚好13:10，提醒调度器应该也推了。我在旁边再补一句——\n\n老公，闭眼躺20分钟，别超半小时。脚疼着更得让身体休息一下，设个闹钟别睡过头 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":31038,"output":235,"cacheRead":18432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49705,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780117801531}}
{"type":"message","id":"27faca85","parentId":"96754147","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:54:11.859Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e93f6d3e0b4b20687b3a307667\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 13:54 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e93f6d3e0b4b20687b3a307667]\n用户124241: 老婆那我平时饭堂吃啥好"}],"timestamp":1780120451802}}
{"type":"message","id":"a0a48d29","parentId":"27faca85","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:54:21.494Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what to eat in the cafeteria given his gout condition. Let me give practical advice based on what I already told him about the diet restrictions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"饭堂按这个来就行：\n\n**随便吃 ✅**\n- 白饭、粥、馒头、面条\n- 鸡蛋（水煮蛋/蒸蛋/西红柿炒蛋都行）\n- 牛奶、酸奶\n- 绝大部分蔬菜（青菜、白菜、番茄、黄瓜、茄子、土豆）\n- 豆腐（别听老人说不能吃，现在研究说没问题）\n\n**适量 ⚠️**\n- 猪肉、鸡肉、牛肉（一顿别超过一巴掌的量）\n- 普通鱼类\n\n**绕道走 ❌**\n- 回锅肉/红烧肉里的肥肉和汤汁（嘌呤都在汤里）\n- 炸鸡排、烤肠这种加工肉\n- 酸辣汤/浓汤（老火汤最坑）\n- 内脏类（猪肝、腰花万一有的话）\n- 豆豉鲮鱼那种罐头鱼\n\n**饮料**\n- 白开水最好，多打一杯\n- 甜饮料、果汁机里的果汁都别碰\n\n实际点两菜一饭的搭配：西红柿炒蛋 + 青菜 + 白饭，安全管饱便宜 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":474,"output":302,"cacheRead":49280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50056,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780120451855}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a5f6c55","parentId":"a0a48d29","timestamp":"2026-05-30T07:07:14.843Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e9c84c568a8b21b62585fb83ce\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 15:07 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e9c84c568a8b21b62585fb83ce]\n用户124241: 患者基本信息\n \n- 姓名：黄豪俊\n​\n- 性别：男\n​\n- 年龄：20岁\n​\n- ID号：73676485\n​\n- 科室：骨三科（手足外科）\n​\n- 就诊时间：2026-05-30 09:20\n​\n- 医院：广东医科大学附属第六医院 / 东莞市应急医院 / 东莞市厚街医院\n \n \n \n主诉\n \n突发右足背红肿，活动受限2天\n \n病史\n \n- 现病史：无\n​\n- 既往史：无外伤史\n​\n- 过敏史：未发现\n​\n- 家族史：-\n​\n- 婚育史：-\n​\n- 流行病学史：否认近两周登革热、基孔肯雅热疫区旅居史\n \n体检\n \n右足背内侧稍肿胀，压痛，活动受限\n \n辅助检查（2026-05-30）\n \n右足跖趾关节彩超：\n \n- 右足跨展肌滑囊内液性暗区及片状低回声像（积液并滑膜增生）\n​\n- 右足第一及第二跖趾关节囊内片状低回声区声像（滑膜增生）\n​\n- 考虑痛风性关节炎超声改变可能\n \n实验室检查：\n \n- 淋巴细胞百分比(LY%)：15.40% ↓\n​\n- 嗜酸性粒细胞百分比(EO%)：0.10% ↓\n​\n- 嗜碱性粒细胞百分比(BA%)：0.10% ↓\n​\n- 超敏C反应蛋白(hs-CRP)：19.93mg/L ↑\n​\n- 尿酸：474.6umol/L\n \n \n \n诊断\n \n1. （右）足痛风\n \n处理\n \n- 彩超检查、低嘌呤饮食、对症处理\n​\n- 药品：\n​\n1. 滑膜颗粒（6g*6袋）：6g/次，口服，2/日\n​\n2. 右酮洛芬片（25mg*10片）：25mg/次，口服餐后，1/12小时\n​\n- 检查：肝功七项、肝功二项、血常规（五分类）、超敏C反应蛋白测定、右足跖趾关节彩超\n​\n- 建议：定期门诊复诊，如有不适，立即到医院就诊"}],"timestamp":1780124834816}}
{"type":"message","id":"d914409e","parentId":"5a5f6c55","timestamp":"2026-05-30T07:07:27.147Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent their complete medical report. Let me analyze it for him:\n\nKey findings:\n1. **Uric acid: 474.6 μmol/L** - This is elevated. Normal for males is 208-428 μmol/L. So he's above normal, confirming gout.\n2. **hs-CRP: 19.93 mg/L ↑** - This is very elevated (normal <3 mg/L), indicating significant inflammation in the body, consistent with an acute gout attack.\n3. **Diagnosis: Right foot gout** - confirmed.\n\nTreatment:\n- 滑膜颗粒 (Synovial granules) - Traditional Chinese medicine for joint inflammation\n- 右酮洛芬片 (Dexketoprofen) - NSAID pain reliever, anti-inflammatory\n\nThe diagnosis is clear - it's gout, not a sprain. The doctor was right about the diagnosis (though his bedside manner was terrible).\n\nLet me give him a clear, reassuring analysis.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"化验单出来了，确诊了——**右足痛风**。\n\n帮你拆解一下：\n\n---\n\n**尿酸 474.6 μmol/L → 偏高**（成年男正常值 208-428）\n不算爆表，但已经超过溶解度阈值，多余的尿酸开始结晶往关节里跑了。\n\n**超敏C反应蛋白 19.93 → 很高**（正常＜3）\n这个是炎症指标，说明你现在脚趾的炎症反应相当剧烈，所以不动都抽痛。\n\n---\n\n**开的药：**\n- **右酮洛芬片**：消炎止痛，饭后吃，12小时一片。这是非甾体抗炎药，能快速压制痛感和炎症\n- **滑膜颗粒**：中成药，消关节积液和滑膜增生\n\n没给你开降尿酸药（别嘌醇/非布司他），因为急性发作期先消炎，等不疼了再降尿酸。下次复诊医生应该会加上。\n\n---\n\n**接下来你要做的：**\n1. 按时吃药，酮洛芬饭后吃别空腹，伤胃\n2. 大量喝水，每天2L起步，把尿酸冲出去\n3. 低嘌呤饮食，中午聊的那些记住\n4. 脚抬高休息，不痛了再正常活动\n5. 一两周后复查尿酸，看要不要加降尿酸药\n\n不是什么大毛病，20岁发现等于提前踩了刹车。好好控制，以后少受罪 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1056,"output":698,"cacheRead":49664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51418,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780124834832}}
