{"type":"message","id":"332b796b","parentId":"97d7a494","timestamp":"2026-05-30T07:30:20.159Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is back at the dorm. I should acknowledge and give some brief advice about next steps - rest, take meds, etc.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"回家就好。吃药、把脚垫高、多喝水，躺着别乱跑 👑\n\n晚饭记得清淡点，18:45 提醒会准时叫你。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":360,"output":90,"cacheRead":53888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54338,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780126216443}}
