{"type":"message","id":"46269995","parentId":"8021b294","timestamp":"2026-05-30T11:42:09.062Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if the 滑膜颗粒 (synovial granule) is a drink that needs to be dissolved in water. Let me check - the prescription says \"滑膜颗粒（6g*6袋）：6g/次，口服，2/日\". \n\nGranules (颗粒) in Chinese medicine typically come in small packets and are meant to be dissolved in warm water and drunk. The prescription says \"口服\" (oral) which is consistent with this. Most Chinese medicine granules are indeed dissolved in water.\n\nLet me answer him.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"对，颗粒就是冲剂，一袋用温水泡开喝掉就行。跟酮洛芬一起饭后服用 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":340,"output":253,"cacheRead":56064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56657,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780141322571}}
