{"type":"message","id":"df61ffb3","parentId":"2aa6240f","timestamp":"2026-05-30T11:45:29.719Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if the 滑膜颗粒 (Chinese medicine granules) is actually effective. Let me give an honest assessment.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"实话实说——滑膜颗粒是中成药，消关节积液和滑膜炎症的，临床上有一定证据但不算强效药。真正帮你止痛的是酮洛芬。\n\n不过医生开了就喝，中成药胜在温和不伤肝肾。两三天后脚不疼了你就知道谁是主力了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":329,"output":119,"cacheRead":56320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56768,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780141524635}}
